  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:09.880" end="00:12.110" ttm:agent="v1">Hehehe, shenrxn</p>
      <p begin="00:12.110" end="00:13.610" ttm:agent="v1">¿What the fuck?</p>
      <p begin="00:13.260" end="00:14.950" ttm:agent="v1">Girl, you know that I'm really fuckin' into you</p>
      <p begin="00:14.950" end="00:17.160" ttm:agent="v1">And I would do anything so that you like me too</p>
      <p begin="00:17.160" end="00:19.120" ttm:agent="v1">You know I'm makin' all these hits, I'm countin' bands in my room</p>
      <p begin="00:19.120" end="00:21.550" ttm:agent="v1">But you know that don't mean a thing if I ain't there next to you</p>
      <p begin="00:21.550" end="00:23.530" ttm:agent="v1">So I'ma send another text and hope that I get a reply</p>
      <p begin="00:23.530" end="00:25.720" ttm:agent="v1">Maybe I could be your shoulder that you go to when you cry</p>
      <p begin="00:25.720" end="00:27.940" ttm:agent="v1">Baby, you know that I'm different, baby, give me a chance</p>
      <p begin="00:27.940" end="00:30.500" ttm:agent="v1">You know I'm thinkin' 'bout you all the time, in a love trance</p>
      <p begin="00:30.500" end="00:32.400" ttm:agent="v1">Girl, you know that I'm really fuckin' into you</p>
      <p begin="00:32.400" end="00:34.410" ttm:agent="v1">And I would do anything so that you like me too</p>
      <p begin="00:34.410" end="00:36.820" ttm:agent="v1">You know I'm makin' all these hits, I'm countin' bands in my room</p>
      <p begin="00:36.820" end="00:39.130" ttm:agent="v1">But you know that don't mean a thing if I ain't there next to you</p>
      <p begin="00:39.130" end="00:41.190" ttm:agent="v1">So I'ma send another text and hope that I get a reply</p>
      <p begin="00:41.190" end="00:43.380" ttm:agent="v1">Maybe I could be your shoulder that you go to when you cry</p>
      <p begin="00:43.380" end="00:45.570" ttm:agent="v1">Baby, you know that I'm different, baby, give me a chance</p>
      <p begin="00:45.570" end="00:48.050" ttm:agent="v1">You know I'm thinkin' 'bout you all the time, in a love trance</p>
      <p begin="00:48.050" end="00:50.000" ttm:agent="v1">Ayy, bitch, I'm creatin' stone hearts, I don't give a fuck 'bout you</p>
      <p begin="00:50.000" end="00:52.430" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause I'm all flexed up, countin' all these checks up too</p>
      <p begin="00:52.430" end="00:54.640" ttm:agent="v1">And I just hopped in, bitch, we finna ride in that coupe</p>
      <p begin="00:54.640" end="00:56.860" ttm:agent="v1">Had to catch my flight just to head to the stu'</p>
      <p begin="00:56.860" end="00:58.890" ttm:agent="v1">I'm livin' rich now, why you stayin' mad?</p>
      <p begin="00:58.890" end="01:00.980" ttm:agent="v1">Saw you just fuckin' broke while my pockets gettin' fat</p>
      <p begin="01:00.980" end="01:03.000" ttm:agent="v1">Had to jump up in the Porsche just to hop up in the Scat</p>
      <p begin="01:03.000" end="01:05.390" ttm:agent="v1">I ain't never goin' slow 'cause I'm always goin' fast</p>
      <p begin="01:05.390" end="01:07.260" ttm:agent="v1">Girl, you know that I'm really fuckin' into you</p>
      <p begin="01:07.260" end="01:09.240" ttm:agent="v1">And I would do anything so that you like me too</p>
      <p begin="01:09.240" end="01:11.590" ttm:agent="v1">You know I'm makin' all these hits, I'm countin' bands in my room</p>
      <p begin="01:11.590" end="01:14.090" ttm:agent="v1">But you know that don't mean a thing if I ain't there next to you</p>
      <p begin="01:14.090" end="01:16.030" ttm:agent="v1">So I'ma send another text and hope that I get a reply</p>
      <p begin="01:16.030" end="01:18.100" ttm:agent="v1">Maybe I could be your shoulder that you go to when you cry</p>
      <p begin="01:18.100" end="01:20.460" ttm:agent="v1">Baby, you know that I'm different, baby, give me a chance</p>
      <p begin="01:20.460" end="01:22.790" ttm:agent="v1">You know I'm thinkin' 'bout you all the time, in a love trance</p>
      <p begin="01:22.790" end="01:24.570" ttm:agent="v1">Girl, you know that I'm really fuckin' into you</p>
      <p begin="01:24.570" end="01:26.790" ttm:agent="v1">And I would do anything so that you like me too</p>
      <p begin="01:26.790" end="01:29.140" ttm:agent="v1">You know I'm makin' all these hits, I'm countin' bands in my room</p>
      <p begin="01:29.140" end="01:31.200" ttm:agent="v1">But you know that don't mean a thing if I ain't there next to you</p>
      <p begin="01:31.200" end="01:33.410" ttm:agent="v1">So I'ma send another text and hope that I get a reply</p>
      <p begin="01:33.410" end="01:35.790" ttm:agent="v1">Maybe I could be your shoulder that you go to when you cry</p>
      <p begin="01:35.790" end="01:37.810" ttm:agent="v1">Baby, you know that I'm different, baby, give me a chance</p>
      <p begin="01:37.810" end="01:39.590" ttm:agent="v1">You know I'm thinkin' 'bout you all the time, in a love trance</p>
